  "question": {
    "text": "The variation of kinetic energy (KE) of a particle executing simple harmonic motion with the displacement (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>) starting from mean position to extreme position (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>) is given by"
